node_modules/
_build/
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.log
*.out

# 🔴 The pipeline's reproduction logs are EVIDENCE, not build output. `*.log` above is a LaTeX rule
# (`paper.log`), and it silently swallowed all 13 files under skills/paper-pipeline/repro/ when they
# arrived — a commit would have carried the eval claims and none of the raw runs behind them, which is
# the exact artifact loss `repro/` exists to prevent. Measured at the moment of the move, not guessed:
# `git check-ignore -v` named this line for every one of them.
!skills/paper-pipeline/repro/*.log

# The accepted papers' own .bbl files are the authors' source, as arXiv published them, not our
# build output (fixtures/real-papers/accepted/README.md).
!fixtures/real-papers/accepted/*/*.bbl
# The e2e fixture of a paper that ships its .bbl without its .bib (#708): the .bbl is the fixture.
!fixtures/build-e2e/shipped-bbl/paper.bbl

dist/
# A skill's TypeScript scripts compiled beside themselves (tsconfig.skills.json): a consumer runs
# them from node_modules, where Node does not strip types. The scripts a SKILL.md runs are then
# replaced by bundles with their dependencies inside (scripts/bundle-skills.ts; shared code in
# dist/skill-chunks/), so they run from a plugin copy with no node_modules. Built by `npm run build` / `prepare`.
skills/*/scripts/*.js
# c8's report and raw V8 data (`npm run coverage`).
coverage/

# eslint-plugin-project-structure writes this into the project root when a preset has no card
# (eslint.config.mjs, presetCards); a clean run removes it.
projectStructure.cache.json

# TeX's own output, captured whole as the readers' test inputs (test/fixtures/tex-output/README.md).
!test/fixtures/tex-output/*/*

# Python bytecode: the novelty checkers (skills/assess-novelty/scripts) are Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# vigiles audit report (generated)
vigiles-report.json
vigiles-report.html

# NeurIPS's author-kit style file, placed beside the NeurIPS e2e fixtures to run them: not
# committed, its licence is unverified (expect.json `needs`; test/e2e/tex/build.e2e.ts skips without it).
fixtures/build-e2e/*/neurips_2026.sty
